  notStartedDialogues:
  - speaker: 0
    text: Now that you know how relics work, let me open my general supply store
      for you.
  - speaker: 1
    text: What kind of items do you sell?
  - speaker: 0
    text: Potions, enhancement materials, and rare tickets. Take a look inside the
      Shop menu!
